 "_doc": "What tools/bake-icons.mjs bakes (stream C, PLAN §16). Units and heroes come from data/units.json and data/looks.json automatically; skills from data/heroes.json (`sprite` here picks the assets/data/fx sprite, else the element default). `items` are generic shop/drop bases by look: `held`/`offhand` are Chibi 2 part ids built on their own, `armour` dresses the warrior in `part` and frames it, `glyph` is a 2D flask/ring/amulet/scroll. The bake writes assets/icons/<kind>/<id>.png and assets/icons/index.json.",
